  "body": "Everything from yachts to cruise ships glide past your window from this charming character villa set directly on Devonport’s iconic waterfront just an easy stroll from the hub of the village and convenience of the city ferry. \r\n\r\nStep across the road and enjoy a choice of golden sand beaches for a quick dip or sit in the shade of Pohutukawa.  Stroll with your children to a choice of parks; swimming and beach activities will become part of your everyday, and you can launch your small boat at the local boat slip just steps from your gate. \r\n\r\nThe charming home is heritage villa charm, renovated to create relaxed coastal living.  Two separate living rooms are perfectly placed for indoor/outdoor flow, the central kitchen connects with both rooms for perfect family living and easy entertaining.   Four bedrooms and two bathrooms within the home are complemented by the separate, self-contained studio apartment, perfect for guests, older children or additional income.   \r\n\r\nOutdoor living is exceptional; a wide deck flows to a sunny, private rear garden with spa pool and sauna - a peaceful retreat after a swim, paddle, beach walk or a morning fish from your dinghy. Solar panels deliver virtually zero energy costs year-round, while a modern heating and cooling system ensures effortless comfort in every season. A garage and additional off-street park at the rear do not obstruct your view or front garden.   \r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful location which delivers a superb lifestyle for families, couples or retirees. Capture this opportunity to secure a waterfront home in one of Auckland’s most historic and coveted seaside villages.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment",
